<title>BELGIUM: EU changes grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU changes grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union changed its grain import duties on Friday after its end-of-month review, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>The new rates are effective as of September 1.  </p>
